---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Security — Fathom" description="Defense in depth — every worker action passes through multiple safety layers. SSRF guards, prompt injection defense, secret scanning, and more.">
  <main class="security-page">
    <div class="container">

      <div class="sec-hero">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="securityPage.hero.badge">Security</p>
        <h1 class="h2-sec" data-i18n="securityPage.hero.title">Defense in depth.</h1>
        <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="securityPage.hero.sub">Every agent action passes through multiple safety layers — from network-level SSRF guards to prompt injection detection, secret scanning, and append-only verification receipts.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-head">
        <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.badge">Security Layers</p>
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.title">12 layers of protection</h2>
        <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.sub">Every outbound request, tool call, and memory write is validated before execution. Failures are never silent.</p>
      </div>

      <div class="api-grid api-grid--3">
        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🛡️</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.ssrf.name">SSRF Guard</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.ssrf.desc">Blocks loopback, RFC1918, link-local, CGNAT, and metadata IPs. Per-hop redirect validation with a max of 5 hops prevents DNS rebinding and open-redirect abuse.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🧬</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.injection.name">Prompt Injection Defense</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.injection.desc">12 detection patterns — ignore_previous, disregard_above, you_are_now, system_prompt_leak, and more. Untrusted content is wrapped with boundary markers before it enters the LLM context.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🔒</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.surfaces.name">Protected Surfaces</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.surfaces.desc">config.toml, memory.db, bible.md, safety.md, secrets.toml, .env, and credentials are blocked from agent modification. Critical configuration is read-only at the tool level.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🔑</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.scanning.name">Secret Scanning</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.scanning.desc">API keys (sk-, AKIA, ghp_, xoxb-, Bearer tokens, PEM blocks) are detected and blocked before they can reach the memory store or be exposed in tool outputs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">⛔</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.destructive.name">Destructive Command Blocking</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.destructive.desc">8 regex patterns block rm -rf /, mkfs, fork bombs, dd of=/dev, chmod -R 777 /, and other catastrophic shell commands before they reach the executor.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🔄</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.doomloop.name">Doom Loop Detection</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.doomloop.desc">3 identical consecutive tool calls trigger a warning. A repeated pattern forces a stop. Runaway agents are halted before they burn tokens or cause side effects.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">📋</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.receipts.name">Verification Receipts</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.receipts.desc">Append-only JSONL ledger with typed identity. Every verification step produces a receipt. A PASS never masks a preceding FAIL — full audit trail, always honest.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🔐</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.auth.name">API Authentication</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.auth.desc">Bearer token or X-Api-Key header required for non-loopback binding. Authentication is mandatory when the server is exposed beyond localhost — no accidental public APIs.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">⏱️</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.ratelimit.name">Rate Limiting</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.ratelimit.desc">Sliding window algorithm, 120 requests per minute per authenticated principal by default. Returns 429 with Retry-After headers when the limit is exceeded.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.fetch.name">Fetch Safety</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.fetch.desc">Response body capped at 2 MiB, text truncated at 50K characters. SSRF guard applied per-hop on every redirect. Prevents memory exhaustion and internal network exfiltration.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">✋</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.gates.name">Approval Gates</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.gates.desc">save_contacts, git_push, and other side-effect tools require explicit human approval before execution. The agent requests, the operator decides.</p>
        </div>

        <div class="api-card">
          <div class="api-icon">🌐</div>
          <div class="api-name" data-i18n="securityPage.layers.cors.name">CORS Policy</div>
          <p data-i18n="securityPage.layers.cors.desc">Permissive CORS only when API authentication is enabled. With auth disabled, CORS is restricted to prevent unauthorized cross-origin access to the agent API.</p>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="feat">
        <div class="feat-copy">
          <p class="eyebrow" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.badge">Verification Pipeline</p>
          <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.title">5-gateway email verification</h2>
          <p class="copy-lg" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.sub">Every email address passes through five sequential verification stages. Each gateway produces a typed receipt. A failure at any stage short-circuits the pipeline — no false positives, no silent passes.</p>
        </div>
        <div class="pipeline-visual">
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <span class="pipeline-num">1</span>
            <div class="pipeline-body">
              <div class="pipeline-name" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s1.name">Syntax</div>
              <p data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s1.desc">RFC 5322 validation. Rejects malformed addresses before any network call.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <span class="pipeline-num">2</span>
            <div class="pipeline-body">
              <div class="pipeline-name" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s2.name">MX Lookup</div>
              <p data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s2.desc">DNS MX record resolution. Domains without mail exchangers are rejected.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <span class="pipeline-num">3</span>
            <div class="pipeline-body">
              <div class="pipeline-name" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s3.name">Disposable Detection</div>
              <p data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s3.desc">Known disposable email providers are flagged and filtered out.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <span class="pipeline-num">4</span>
            <div class="pipeline-body">
              <div class="pipeline-name" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s4.name">Role-based Check</div>
              <p data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s4.desc">info@, admin@, support@ and similar role addresses are flagged as low-value.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
          <div class="pipeline-arrow">→</div>
          <div class="pipeline-step">
            <span class="pipeline-num">5</span>
            <div class="pipeline-body">
              <div class="pipeline-name" data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s5.name">SMTP Probe</div>
              <p data-i18n="securityPage.pipeline.s5.desc">Live SMTP handshake to verify the mailbox actually exists without sending mail.</p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-stats">
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-value">12</div>
          <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="securityPage.stats.patterns">injection patterns detected</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-value">8</div>
          <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="securityPage.stats.destructive">destructive command patterns</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-value">5</div>
          <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="securityPage.stats.pipeline">verification gateways</div>
        </div>
        <div class="stat-card">
          <div class="stat-value">0</div>
          <div class="stat-label" data-i18n="securityPage.stats.silent">silent failures</div>
        </div>
      </div>

      <div class="sec-cta">
        <h2 class="h3-sec" data-i18n="securityPage.cta.title">Security is not optional</h2>
        <p class="copy-lg mx-auto" data-i18n="securityPage.cta.sub">Every layer is on by default. No opt-in flags, no configuration required. Read the full security architecture in the documentation.</p>
        <div class="cta-actions">
          <a href="/docs" class="btn btn-primary" data-i18n="securityPage.cta.docs">Read the docs</a>
          <a href="/architecture" class="btn btn-secondary" data-i18n="securityPage.cta.arch">View architecture</a>
        </div>
      </div>

    </div>
  </main>
</Layout>

<style>
  .security-page { padding: 70px 0 90px; }

  .eyebrow { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-size: 13px; letter-spacing: .16px; text-transform: uppercase; color: var(--grey-600); }
  .h2-sec { font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.03em; line-height: 1.02; }
  .h3-sec { font-size: clamp(20px, 2.4vw, 34px); font-weight: 500; letter-spacing: -0.02em; margin: 12px 0 16px; }
  .copy-lg { color: var(--grey-700); font-size: 17px; line-height: 1.55; max-width: 640px; }
  .mx-auto { margin-left: auto; margin-right: auto; }

  .sec-hero {
    max-width: 820px;
    margin: 0 auto 56px;
    text-align: center;
    padding: 0 24px;
  }

  .sec-hero h1 {
    font-size: clamp(34px, 5vw, 68px);
    font-weight: 500;
    letter-spacing: -0.03em;
    line-height: 1.02;
    margin-top: 12px;
  }

  .sec-hero .copy-lg { margin-top: 20px; }

  .sec-head {
    max-width: 640px;
    margin: 0 auto 36px;
    text-align: center;
  }

  .api-grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); gap: 2px; background: var(--grey-300); border-radius: var(--radius-lg); overflow: hidden; border: 1px solid var(--grey-300); margin-top: 30px; }
  .api-card { background: var(--bg-card); padding: 26px 24px; display: flex; flex-direction: column; gap: 8px; transition: background var(--duration) var(--ease-out); }
  .api-card:hover { background: var(--bg-secondary); }
  .api-card .api-name { font-family: var(--font-mono); font-weight: 600; font-size: 15px; }
  .api-card p { color: var(--grey-600); font-size: 14px; line-height: 1.5; }
  .api-icon { font-size: 1.5rem; margin-bottom: 4px; }
  @media (max-width: 800px) { .api-grid { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .api-grid--3 {
    grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr);
  }
  @media (max-width: 1000px) { .api-grid--3 { grid-template-columns: repeat(2, 1fr); } }
  @media (max-width: 700px) { .api-grid--3 { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } }

  .feat { display: grid; grid-template-columns: 1fr 1.2fr; gap: 48px; align-items: center; padding: 64px 0; }
  @media (max-width: 900px) { .feat { grid-template-columns: 1fr; gap: 28px; } }

  .pipeline-visual {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 0;
  }

  .pipeline-step {
    display: flex;
    gap: 16px;
    align-items: flex-start;
    padding: 20px 24px;
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-200);
    border-radius: var(--radius-md);
    background: var(--bg-card);
    transition: border-color var(--duration) var(--ease-out);
  }

  .pipeline-step:hover {
    border-color: var(--grey-400);
  }

  .pipeline-num {
    display: flex;
    align-items: center;
    justify-content: center;
    width: 32px;
    height: 32px;
    min-width: 32px;
    border-radius: 50%;
    background: var(--grey-900);
    color: var(--grey-50);
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-size: 13px;
    font-weight: 700;
  }

  .pipeline-body {
    display: flex;
    flex-direction: column;
    gap: 4px;
  }

  .pipeline-name {
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
    font-weight: 600;
    font-size: 14px;
    color: var(--text-primary);
  }

  .pipeline-body p {
    color: var(--grey-600);
    font-size: 13px;
    line-height: 1.45;
  }

  .pipeline-arrow {
    display: flex;
    justify-content: center;
    padding: 4px 0;
    color: var(--grey-400);
    font-size: 18px;
  }

  .sec-stats {
    display: grid;
    grid-template-columns: repeat(4, 1fr);
    gap: 2px;
    background: var(--grey-300);
    border-radius: var(--radius-lg);
    overflow: hidden;
    border: 1px solid var(--grey-300);
    margin: 48px 0;
  }

  .stat-card {
    background: var(--bg-card);
    text-align: center;
    padding: 40px 20px;
  }

  .stat-value {
    font-size: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
    font-weight: 800;
    letter-spacing: -0.04em;
    color: var(--text-primary);
    line-height: 1;
    margin-bottom: 8px;
    font-family: var(--font-mono);
  }

  .stat-label {
    font-size: 0.875rem;
    color: var(--grey-600);
    font-weight: 500;
  }

  @media (max-width: 700px) { .sec-stats { grid-template-columns: 1fr 1fr; } }

  .sec-cta {
    text-align: center;
    padding: 64px 0 24px;
  }

  .cta-actions {
    display: flex;
    gap: 12px;
    justify-content: center;
    margin-top: 32px;
    flex-wrap: wrap;
  }
</style>
